{"title": "Status properties/RemoveOnLongRest", "pageid": 45449, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Status_properties/RemoveOnLongRest", "categories": ["Status properties"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">Status properties</a>.</div>\n<p><b>RemoveOnLongRest</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Status_property\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status property\">status property</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"List_of_conditions_with_RemoveOnLongRest\">List of conditions with RemoveOnLongRest</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Daylight\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Daylight_(Condition)\" title=\"Daylight (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Daylight_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Daylight_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Daylight_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Daylight_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Daylight_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Daylight_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Daylight\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Daylight_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Daylight_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/Daylight_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Daylight_(Condition)\" title=\"Daylight (Condition)\">Daylight</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Shining with the light of the sun. Dispels <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Darkness_(cloud)\" title=\"Darkness (cloud)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp/25px-Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp/38px-Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp/50px-Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Darkness\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp/25px-Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Darkness_(cloud)\" title=\"Darkness (cloud)\">Darkness</a> within a radius of 15 m (50 ft).</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Daylight:_Enchant_Item\" title=\"Daylight: Enchant Item\">Enchant Item</a> version of this spell requires the target creature have a <a href=\"/wiki/Weapons\" title=\"Weapons\">Weapon</a> in their main hand.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Elemental_Weapon:_Acid\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Weapon:_Acid_(Condition)\" title=\"Elemental Weapon: Acid (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Elemental_Weapon_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Elemental_Weapon_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Elemental_Weapon_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Elemental_Weapon_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Elemental_Weapon_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Elemental_Weapon_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elemental Weapon: Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Elemental_Weapon_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Elemental_Weapon_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d3/Elemental_Weapon_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Weapon:_Acid_(Condition)\" title=\"Elemental Weapon: Acid (Condition)\">Elemental Weapon: Acid</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Has a +1 bonus to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> and deals an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></spa