<a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> and deals an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/29px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/39px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">Cold</span></a> damage.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Elemental_Weapon:_Fire\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Weapon:_Fire_(Condition)\" title=\"Elemental Weapon: Fire (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Elemental_Weapon_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Elemental_Weapon_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Elemental_Weapon_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Elemental_Weapon_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Elemental_Weapon_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Elemental_Weapon_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elemental Weapon: Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Elemental_Weapon_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Elemental_Weapon_Fire_Condition_